            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A floor saw (100, 100a, 100b) comprising a control unit (130) and an arrangement configured to determine a weight and/or volume of accumulated dust or slurry in a dust container (180) mounted on the floor saw, where the control unit (130) is arranged to detect when the weight and/or volume of accumulated dust or slurry exceeds a preconfigured threshold and to transmit a signal to a remote control device (310) indicating that the weight and/or volume of accumulated dust or slurry is above the preconfigured threshold.</p>
